window.products.push({"id":1071140,"name":"MALACASA Square Coasters for Drinks,4Inch Slate Drink Coasters Cheese Board,Black Coaster for Cups,Gourmet,Crackers and Brie - Set of 8","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91EmLXFGTOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Your living room is probably a wonderfully kept place. But it’s not too exciting either. What you need is something to brighten things up, to bring a bit of life to it. What you need is a bunch of classy-looking coasters and serving mat to solve your worries. Features of Slate Board: - Made from high-quality slate that will minimize spillage. - Soft pad underside that won’t scratch and grips the table surface to keep your drink in place. - Eco-friendly and harmless natural slate board can put food directly on it. -Each natural board is hand cut and has a unique flaked edge. Points to Note: 1. Do not scratch with sharp objects to avoid damage to the surface texture. 2. Not dishwasher or oven safe. 3. Clean after each use by wiping with warm, soapy water and a non-abrasive cloth. 4. The food can be in direct contact with the slate mat, and the surface texture. With these fantastic coasters all your gift-giving nightmares are over. Ideal gift for birthdays, housewarming, for potlucks, buffets and cocktail parties. With their serious quality and serious fun-factor these coasters are a great conversation piece and party starter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91EmLXFGTOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MALACASA","source_asin":"B07Z63Q9FT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1071140","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Z63Q9FT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Z63Q9FT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
