window.products.push({"id":1071160,"name":"Veronese Design 10 1/4 Inch Celtic Goddess Morrigan with Crow and Sword Resin Statue Bronze Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.75,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511xGxQFk0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"In Irish mythology, The Morrigan is a Goddess of Battle associated with fate, birth and death and is otherwise known as the Phantom Queen or the Great Queen, both appropriate epithets, as she often appears in the guise of a crow. The Morrigan is depicted here wearing a daring blue dress, holding a sword and ready for battle. A crow swoops down to perch on the soft landing of her open palm. Her hair is long with two braids in the front and worn loose, allowing her wavy tendrils to flow freely. Intricately sculpted in cold cast resin, you'll marvel at the colored effects. Take notice of the colored effects that bring The Morrigan to life in this conceptual statue. 10.25 inch high x 6.5 inch long x 3 inch wide. It's a striking piece rich with Celtic symbols and a must-have piece for any followers of nature religions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/511xGxQFk0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Veronese Design","source_asin":"B06XYL94D5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1071160","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XYL94D5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XYL94D5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
