window.products.push({"id":1071270,"name":"XINFULL 4 Pack Wire Storage Baskets Household Metal Containers Organizer Bins with Handles for Kitchen Freezer Pantry Closet Laundry Room Bathroom Cab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-MXhrsXbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"4 PACK with 2 SIZE: 4 Pack include 2 large and 2 middle storage racks, 2 Large size: Top - 13.8(L) x 11.0(W) inch, Bottom - 11.8(L) x 9.8(W) inch, Overall height is 5.9 inch; 2 Middle size: Top - 11.0(L) x 8.3(W) inch, Bottom - 9.4(L) x 6.7(W) inch, Overall height is 4.7 inch.MULTI-FUNCTUAL USAGE: IDEAL BASKET-Perfect for homes, apartments, condos, dorm rooms, RVs and campers. This bin keeps clean and save room under control by storing all of your essentials - foods, hats, scarves, video games, laundry needs, craft supplies and more.This metal wire basket is the perfect solution for organizing a multitude of items, Use in kitchen, refrigerator, bathroom, bedroom, closet, laundry room, utility room, garage, hobby and craft room, home office, mudroom and entryways.PORTABLE HANDLES: Wire storage basket with easy-grip built-in side handles make it convenient to pull this tote off the shelf, out of cabinets or wherever you store them. The integrated handles make these perfect for upper shelves, you can use the handles to pull them down. Use multiple bins together to create a customized organization system that works for you. Keep items organized and easy to find with this vintage-inspired modern wire bins.Durable & Rustproof: The household organizer is made of sturdy steel wire and rust-resistant coated, durable and last for years. Elegant color matches perfectly with a variety of home styles and furniture designs. Easy to clean by wiping with a damp cloth.INSTANT ORGANIZATION: This bin keeps kitchen clutter under control by storing all of your essentials. Store and organize pasta, packets, salt dressing and vinegars, macaroni and cheese boxes, water bottles, soda pop cans, juice boxes, snacks, pouches, onions, apples, baking supplies, and condiments. Large sized, you will find many uses for these storage bins.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-MXhrsXbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XINFULL","source_asin":"B08PBZNB7V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1071270","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PBZNB7V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PBZNB7V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
