window.products.push({"id":1071373,"name":"Damascus Chef Knife with Whetstone Sharpener – 8 inch Professional VG10 Chefs Knife – Full Tang Sharp Japanese Chef Knife with G10 Handle and Protecti","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SYLJjQaoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sharp and Precise- Minimize slips and eventual injury in the kitchen by always maintaining a sharp blade on your Damascus Chef knife. Our VG10 Damascus chef’s knife comes with a dual-sided mini whetstone with a silicone base to create a non-slip surface. Start with the 1000 grit course side, followed by the fine 3000 grit side for precision sharpening. REAL Damascus Chefs Knife - Last Damascus Knife You Will Ever Need. Our 8 inch chef knife performs and looks spectacular in Any Kitchen. The 67 layer Damascus steel knife mends layered strength with an aesthetic finish. It will hardly ever bend and it is difficult to break. The VG10 Steel professional knife is Cryogenically Treated, a deep-freezing procedure, to enhance the performance of the blade. A Chef’s Dream With Superior Performance and Durability. Rated at 60HRC this chef's knife is tough and will hold its sharpness for longer. The 12-15 degrees angle on each side of the blade enhances the cutting performance of this uniquely sharp knife. A sharp kitchen knife makes cutting meats and vegetables smooth and effortless. Easier Chopping For Extended Periods Of Time. This professional chef knife boasts a full tang robust blade that is perfectly balanced, and an ergonomically designed G10 resin handle to grant superior hand control and comfort. This full tang knife will last for a lifetime in your kitchen due to its strength and highly water-resistant properties. The G10 handle won't crack, break, chip, or scratch easily. Your Favorite Chef or Food Lover Deserves a Stunning Gift Set. Give the gift that keeps on giving as our premium quality magnetic cover gift box is dazzling. Perfect for a Father's Day Gift. We at Buonelle are committed to happy customers. If for any reason you or your loved one don’t absolutely love your knife, reach out to our amazing customer delight team and we will work with you until you are happy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SYLJjQaoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Buonelle","source_asin":"B09RTK5CGW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1071373","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09RTK5CGW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09RTK5CGW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
