window.products.push({"id":1071386,"name":"Ice Cube Tray, Rose Ice Cube Molds Reusable Silicone Flexible 4-Ice Trays Maker with Cover for Chilling Cocktails, Whiskey, Bourbon & Homemade Juice, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71De2XuqyIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ROSE ICE CUBES - Rose ice cube molds make 4 large rose ice balls at one time. The diameter of each rose ice is 2.5”. Long-lasting rose ices make your beverages cool longer, perfect for cocktails, iced coffee, iced tea, fruit juice, whisky, and bourbon. Excellent for chilling your cocktail glass! LEAK-PROOF & EASY RELEASE - Upgrade connection edge slot between the bottom and the cover work great to prevent water from spilling. Rose ice ball form comes with a tiny funnel to fill each rose section, put it in the freezer for 5-6 hours. Easy to pull apart and take out the ices perfectly once frozen. GREAT FOR ALL OCCASIONS - Rose shapes ice cube tray is a fun way to make a cocktail party special. Even if it's only a drink with a friend! A nice specialty ice cube tray would be a big hit at the drunk night, date night, and party punch to win many compliments. Great for home bars, beaches, offices, holiday events, and holiday gifts. SAFE, DURABLE SILICONE ICE TRAY - Made of premium silicone, the ice cube maker is flexible and sturdy, freezer, microwave, and dishwasher safe. Safe and effective in freezing juice, jellos, homemade chocolates, soaps, candles, etc. Please remember to soak it in hot water before first use. DRESS UP YOUR VALENTINES DRINKS - Valentine's day gifts for him/her! Rose and drinks are a must for a romantic date. Most adorable rose ice cubes are perfect for a cocktail night with your precious. Amazing beautiful rose ices floating in drinks can create a more romantic atmosphere for your date. Really a fantastic addition to drinks when you surprised your loved ones with a rose ice cube.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71De2XuqyIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"yoomens","source_asin":"B0B5RKCCBN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1071386","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5RKCCBN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5RKCCBN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
