window.products.push({"id":1071408,"name":"CocoSoy Organic Candles Natural Flower Extracted Fragrance Oils \"Bergamot Grapefruit & Ginger\" Botanical Candles for Aromatherapy Home Scent 18 Oz/3 W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.75,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81l7X1QoRRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CocoSoy Highly Scented Candles and its ParkAvenue Botanical collection bring to your home the organic fresh scent packaged in a Wood-Lid Thick Glass Jar. Our EcoAroma Essential Oils are extracted from organic plants and flowers creating the scent of ambergris and Clove, Velvet Rose combined with base notes of Violet Leaf, Oud and Patchouli that lingers in air for days. TOP NOTES: Ambergris, Lemon Oil MIDDLE NOTES: Clove, Velvet Rose BASE NOTES: Violet Leaf, Oud, Patchouli Discover the finely-fragranced ParkAvenue collection and embrace the natural charm and extravagance of CocoSoy Scented Organic Candles with Non-Paraffin wax. Experience an array of soothing, energizing, and refreshing scents. Features: - Pine Lid Thick Glass Jar - Organic Coconut-Soy Wax and Top Tier Fragrance Oils. - 100% cotton natural fiber wicks by Atkin & Pearces, USA. - Biodegradable and sustainable. ABOUT US: CocoSoy Candles began as an innovative EcoLab applying Cornell's Plant Sciences and bringing to the market the best sustainable, eco friendly candles. Our objective is to replace millions of tons of harmful paraffin candles that release toxic fumes everyday. We combine the molecular structures of natural Coconut Soy Palm, flowers and plants to create candles that burn efficiently and release pure fresh air with natural aromas. We invented a special distillation process that has enabled us to manufacture plant-based wax that is cheaper than the paraffin wax. By using CocoSoy Candles, you can save money and save the planet by eliminating millions of tons of harmful petroleum paraffin.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81l7X1QoRRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CocoSoy Candles","source_asin":"B09NJH7QGL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1071408","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NJH7QGL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NJH7QGL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
