window.products.push({"id":1071416,"name":"Dishwasher Magnet Cover,Forest Deer Moose,Home Kitchen Decoration,Rustic Farm Animal Sticker Decorative Refrigerator,Vintage Fall Winter Spring Floral","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.75,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-D-A4wIpL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"The Dishwasher Cover adds a touch of real beauty to your plain looking dishwasher,it’s a Magnet Art, adds style with a cozy feeling. It would be pretty on anything you placed it on, absolutely love it. The Magnetic Stickers hide scratches, dents, or other unsightly marks.With a smooth surface that is environmentally safe, easy to remove with no sticky residue.The cover can be used on dishwasher and fridge door and any metal or stainless home Appliance surface with magnetism. Also,it’s a wonderful gift for friends, elders, and yourself, on Mother’s Day, Christmas, Easter, New Year’s Day, Washington’s birthday and other holidays.When a friend comes as a guest, he will be surprised. Two Sizes for select: S: 23x17inch (58.5x43cm) M: 23X26inch (58.5x66cm) Warm tips: 1.The Cover is a magnetic sticker, pls make sure your dishwasher door is magnetic. 2. Please confirm the size of the dishwasher before buying and whether it is magnetic. 3. Due to the inconsistent calibration of the monitor, the colors on the computer monitor may be slightly different.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-D-A4wIpL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YouRkey","source_asin":"B0BMTN89SW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1071416","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMTN89SW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMTN89SW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1071417,"name":"SNUGACE Black Metal Framed Mirror Rectangle Wall Mount Bathroom Vanity Mirror, 24” X 36”","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.1,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xHDsot1IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This metal framed rounded corner rectangular wall mirror is a sleek, contemporary design that shines in modern, vintage, farmhouse, and midcentury interiors. It's ideal over a single or double bathroom vanity, but can also serve as a high-quality accent piece in an entryway, bedroom, living room, or dining room. The aluminum frame material is more durable and resists flaking, cracking, and water damage. Constructed of premium-quality 1/4-inch glass, the mirror's reflection is crisp and distortion-free. Authentic silver backing on the glass prevents corrosion in high-humidity environments. The Ultra-Flush Mounting System allows for quick and secure installation in both vertical and horizontal orientations and comes prepackaged with drywall anchors and screws. This bathroom vanity mirror is currently offered in 20x28, 24x36, and 30x36 sizes in two colors: black, gold.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xHDsot1IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SNUGACE","source_asin":"B0C77Y1RKT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1071417","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C77Y1RKT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C77Y1RKT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1071418,"name":"HALLOLUX Hxeredue YuanKanJu JyARz Eco-Friendly Storage Container - 2 PACK (Black, Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cc8AnqO7L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Whether you travel, surf, hike, ski, or enjoy music festivals with friends the JYARZ Classic offers portable, airtight, glass-lined, eco-friendly containers. JYARZ unique TripleBlock design offers three layers of freshness enhancing and odor control. An air-tight seal is formed where the exterior cap and shell meet. Because this first seal is formed outside the threads, the entire container and its contents can be submerged in hot soapy water...clean it \"cap-to-base\" in seconds. A thick silicone gasket inside the cap, forms the second airtight seal where it meets the inner glass core. Each and every JYARZ provides you with 3 layers of odor and freshness enhancing protection. The outer shell and cap are made of recycled HPDE plastic which is waxy and slick, so smelly substances don't readily adhere to it. Convenient storage for your active life style. The JYARZ Classic have big enough to provide capacity for a day trip or evening out without being too bulky to carry. The glass core and tough outer shell help ensure that the contents are protected. Glass is inert, free of chemicals, BPA's or Phthalates and it is easy to remove and clean. Thick food grade silicone gaskets form a super tight and reliable seal which keeps the odor and freshness in. The rugged HDPE plastic provides another layer of protection from harmful UV rays and protects the glass inside from knocks and spills. The colorful outer shell is made from 100% recycled milk jugs. We care deeply about the environment and make a donation of every sale to organizations researching and publicizing the perils of ocean plastic.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81cc8AnqO7L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JYARZ","source_asin":"B00DTKASIM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1071418","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DTKASIM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DTKASIM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1071419,"name":"Baxton Studio Avril Modern and Contemporary Black Faux Leather Tufted Swivel Barstool with Nail heads Trim","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":320.01,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91+vpZQZo+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Featuring elegant and sophisticated design, the Avril swivel barstool is another piece of our modern and contemporary collection. The barstool has a wide curved button-tufted seat back. Underneath the seat, It has a metal plate supporting the swivel mechanism. Four straight legs finished in dark espresso brown and built with solid rubber wood supporting the seat sturdily. Fully upholstered in faux leather, The wide seating area is padded throughout for a comfortable reign. There is visible showed stitching's on the back and seat to enhance the Class and elegance of this barstool. The button-tufting and nail heads trim on the edges reconfirm the modern and contemporary design. This piece would fit extremely well in a hotel bar or restaurant bar environment with it swivel function. Made in Malaysia, the barstool is offered in set of two and it requires assembly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91+vpZQZo+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baxton Studio","source_asin":"B07T6BZ4JV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1071419","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07T6BZ4JV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07T6BZ4JV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1071420,"name":"KUFUNG Pizza Cutter Wheel, Super Sharp Pizza Slicer with Non Slip Handle for Pizza, Pies, Waffles and Dough Cookies, Easy to Use and Clean (Green)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.28,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PHRxLi6wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Sharp Blade That Stays Sharp】 ：The cutter wheel is made entirely of high quality stainless steel with excellent anti rust performance, the wheel is crafted to cut through pizza quickly and safely with minimal effort. 【Widely Used】 : Great for the usage to cut pizza, lasagna, fudge, among other foods. 【Non Slip Handle】 : The handle is made with non slip ABS padded, its curved handle design with ergonomic aims to provide you with max comfort. 【Easy To Clean】: this is heat resistant and cleaning is a breeze. Simply hand-wash it with warm water and soap and it will look as good as new. 【Easy To Storage】 - Compared with the bulky pizza rocker that is not suitable for putting in the kitchen cabinet, this uniquely designed pizza cutter can be easily put into the cutlery drawer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PHRxLi6wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KUFUNG","source_asin":"B09VPX6H17","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1071420","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VPX6H17","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VPX6H17","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
