window.products.push({"id":1071451,"name":"Saffron Fabs Bath Rug 100% Soft Cotton, Size 50x30 Inch, Latex Spray Non-Skid Backing, Multiple Brorwn Color Pebble Stone Pattern, Machine Washable","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1QfJO8e0mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Decorate your home/bathroom with this Saffron Fabs stone pattern cotton bath rug. This rug features a latex spray non-skid backing, multiple color pebble stone pattern that adds a modern, relaxed feel to your bathroom. This rug is made of 100Percent soft cotton to provide higher water absorbance, perfect for bathrooms as these soaks water quickly. Thick pile texture enhances its softness. This rug is available in many colors such as beige, blue, gray, green, ivory and white. Currently available in size 50-Inch x 30-Inch to fit in any available space. These rugs are dyed with colors using sustainable Azo free dyes. Saffron Fabs bath rugs can be used as area rug in kitchen, bedroom, hotels, and spa etc. These rugs are machine washable, cold separately; gentle cycle. Do not pull long yarn ends; trim with scissors. Please do not select thick (heavier GSF) rugs if door opens on top of rug as it may cause issues opening the door. Most cotton rugs are handmade in different lots, therefore there might be some variance in color/size/design. Also, rugs are folded after manufacturing to put on cartons for shipping, and many times crease/fold line are very visible, which will settle after some period of usage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1QfJO8e0mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Saffron Fabs","source_asin":"B08HF2KKH1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1071451","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HF2KKH1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HF2KKH1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
