window.products.push({"id":1071558,"name":"altCookingHub Silicone Stretch Lids, 6-Pack of Same Size 4.5 Inch Lids, BPA Free, Leakproof Reusable Silicone Lids for Various Shapes of Containers an","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MIawvNUXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This silicone stretchable lids set includes 6 pieces of 4.5 inch. The reusable lids conform to various shapes (round, oval, square, rectangular and odd shaped containers), even your half-cut lemon or melon, and create a leakproof seal. Compatible with most surfaces including glass, plastic, aluminum, melamine, ceramic, stainless steel, and more. HEAT AND COLD RESISTANT: These silicone lids are heat and cold resistant up to 445 °F, so place it over any dish in the oven but not direct heat, use it in the microwave, store it in the freezer, or toss it in the dishwasher. These lids are durable and perfectly safe for all-around your kitchen! DO YOU HAVE LEFTOVERS? Don’t throw it away! Simply cover and airtight seal it with these silicone wraps to keep it fresh! The silicone food saver lids can be used to cover cooked food, fruit, salads, sauces, as well as drinks like coffee, soda, juice and more. ABSOLUTELY SAFE MATERIALS: Your safety is our top priority, for this reason, we’ve made sure the silicone stretching lids are BPA-free, food grade, No Filler and completely nontoxic. You can use the stretch lids without worrying about your family’s health! ECO-FRIENDLY AND ECONOMICAL: The reusable stretch and seal lids will reduce your plastic waste and help you save money, since you will no longer need to buy plastic food wrap to cover your leftover food fresh dishes. Plus, the bowl lid does a much better job at keeping your food fresh! Care & Usage:- Do not expose to direct heat or flame- Do not completely seal the container when using in microwave or oven- Dishwasher safe (Top Rack)- Operating temperature -40 °F to 445 °F -Select a cover size that is slightly smaller than container size, as this will ensure that the food is being properly sealed","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MIawvNUXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"altCooking Hub","source_asin":"B08MV9HH8P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1071558","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MV9HH8P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MV9HH8P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
