window.products.push({"id":1071628,"name":"Soil pH Meter, 3-in-1 Soil Test Kit for Moisture, Light & pH, A Must Tool for Home, Garden, Lawn, Farm, Plants, Herbs & Gardening Tools, Indoor/Outdoo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Dy9jNnxSS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Soil test kit Reading :🌸🌸Moisture Range: 1-10 (1-3 DRY, 4-7 NOR, 8-10 WET).🌸🌸Relative Light: 0-2000 Lux (0-200 LOW, 200-500LOW+, 500-1000 NOR 1000-2000 HGH).🌸🌸PH Range: 3.5-8 pH (3.5-6.5 ACID, 7 NOR, 7-8 ALKALI).🌸🌸Soil Test Kit Color: Green SOIL TEST KIT SIZE 🌻🌻Probe length: 7 inch.🌻🌻Distance between probes: 0.5 inch.🌻🌻Copper or Aluminum probe diameter: 5 mm.🌻🌻Package weight: 3.5 oz. HANDY SHOVEL 🌺🌺Length:10 inch.🌺🌺Width:3.15 inch.🌺🌺Material: Carbon Steel🌺🌺SHOVEL COLOR PACKED RANDOMLY USAGE OF SOIL TESTING METER (No Batteries Needed, Plug and Read)🌷🌷 Switch moisture/pH/light on very position.🌷🌷 Insert the testing probe slowly and vertically into the soil about 4-6 inches.🌷🌷 Adjust the position of the probe until the pointer on the dial swing slightly.🌷🌷 After 10 minutes, Note moisture/pH/light level in the dial.🌷🌷 Remove probe from soil and wipe clean after each use. WARNING TIPS 🌻🌻 Do not insert the soil meter into very hard soil or touch hard objects, easy to damage the probe.🌻🌻 Do not use the soil ph meter to test pure water directly or other liquids, electrolytic response index will be affected, it can only be used to measure the soil.🌻🌻 Don't use the probe near the magnetic material and away from other metal objects.🌻🌻 To maximize the accuracy of sunlight readings, point the light sensor at the top front of the meter toward the sun.🌻🌻 Wipe the probe clean with a soft, damp cloth and dry it before and after each measurement.🌻🌻 Do not leave the probe inserted in soil longer than necessary to make a measurement.🌻🌻 The indicator will not move if the soil is too dry, before you test it, you can water the plant first. Package Included :🌸🌸3 in 1 Soil Tester🌸🌸Handy Shovel🌸🌸Thanks card","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Dy9jNnxSS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MiKoSoRu","source_asin":"B07DTW2VG4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1071628","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DTW2VG4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DTW2VG4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
