window.products.push({"id":1071634,"name":"UniTendo 4-Piece Duvet Cover Sets 3D Beautiful Galaxy Boho Blue Digital Bedding High Definition Carbon Charming Tree and Star Light Print Twin Size. (","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713NxpSii+L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"Welcome to UniTendo~Size Tip: Twin :Duvet Cover 60*80 inch(59.06\"); Flat Sheet 72*92 inch(70.87\"); 2 Pillowcase 20*28 inch(19.69\") Full:Duvet Cover 80*92 inch(78.74\"); Flat Sheet 92*98 inch(90.55\"); 2 Pillowcase 20*28 inch(19.69\") Queen :Duvet Cover 90*96 inch(88.58\"); Flat Sheet 92*100 inch(90.55\"); 2 Pillowcase 20*28 inch(19.69\") King:Duvet Cover 104*90 inch(102.36\"); Flat Sheet 112*100 inch(110.24\"); 2 Pillowcase 20*28 inch(19.69\") Gross Weight/Package:3.00-4.00(kg) Thread Count:800 Suitable Season: All the Seasons Fillings: No DUVET COVER: A duvet cover is a protective layer that slips over the duvet and has a closure. Because duvets and comforters can be expensive and difficult to clean, duvet covers are useful because they protect your comforter during use and are easily removed and easy to wash.you can also quickly and easily change the look of your bed and room without having to completely redecorate.The duvet cover also allows you to change your style or color of your bedding with the simple switch of the cover. HOW TO USE DUVET COVER :1) Lay the comforter flat. 2) Insert your hands inside and find the two top corners. holding one corner in each hand. 3) With your hands inside the duvet cover, reach down to grab hold of the comforter’s top two corners. 4) Holding the top two corners tightly, give it a shake and a fluff until the duvet cover falls down to cover most of the comforter. 5) Stuff the bottom two corners of the comforter inside the bottom two corners of the duvet cover. zip it up at last! Washing Instructions: Wash Method: Machine Washable & Hand WashableNatural dry and ironing allowed Please dissolve natural detergent in the water about 30°C beforehand then put bedding sets in.Please don't directly spread chemical detergent on bedding sets.Due to differences in monitor settings, there may be a slight variation in color on screen,versus the actual mater","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713NxpSii+L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UniTendo","source_asin":"B07LG345X4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1071634","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07LG345X4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07LG345X4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
