window.products.push({"id":1071819,"name":"Excellent Bamboo Cane MATE - Directy from Argentina - KIT with bronze and nickel straw (\"Bombilla\") with filter + YERBA MATE herb tea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tFK6nfGuL._AC_.jpg","description":"This is the world famous argentinean MATE, spreaded in all Southern South America, for drinking the MATE herb tea...(both, the mug and the herb, are named the same way) The herb (YERBA MATE), is a natural source of energy, discovered by the pre-columbus indians, and cultivated in Argentina, Uruguay, Brazil and Paraguay ever since. The MATE mug, is made out of natural bamboo cane, conveniently processed. The \"Bombilla\" is the straw used for drinking the Mate tea, or any drink you might have in your mate...It has a filter on one end, so, it's performance is awsome!...Easy to use, easy to wash, easy to clean...Made in Nickel and Bronze. Best quality in both, the MATE and the BOMBILLA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tFK6nfGuL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Best of Argentina","source_asin":"B0031M5JYQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1071819","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0031M5JYQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0031M5JYQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
