window.products.push({"id":1071950,"name":"Degrenne | Luxury French Teapot | Salam Collection | 4 Cups | White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":158.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61e1kqK6YpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Salam teapot was created in 1953 and is Degrenne' s flagship product. The finesse of the porcelain combined with the shimmer of the teapot's body enhances the tea drinking experience. The Salam's body is cleverly lined by a felt sleeve, keeping tea at an optimum temperature for twice as long as a classic teapot (approximately two and a half hour). The pot's removable filter reveals all the subtlety of tea and prevents the bitter taste that comes from brewing tea for too long. The Salam's timeless design, blend of porcelain and stainless steel, and its combination of finishes make this teapot truly unique: every 20 minutes, somewhere in the world someone buys a Salam teapot !.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61e1kqK6YpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DEGRENNE","source_asin":"B0C25SJJSM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1071950","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C25SJJSM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C25SJJSM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
